# No active exceptions. Re-verified 2026-09-12 with trivy 0.74.0 against
# ghcr.io/keleyaa/myurls:v2.0.8: the image now reports no CRITICAL or HIGH
# findings, so the previous libssh2 exceptions (CVE-2026-58050, CVE-2026-7598)
# and the libpcre2 findings (CVE-2026-86145, CVE-2026-89161) are all resolved
# by the upstream rebuild that installs libpcre2-8-0 10.42-1+deb12u1.
